ot provide such services, and storage is generally limited to 3 days"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/25-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"Disagreement over cause of death: request an autopsy within 48 hours and have medical records sealed"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/25-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Legal deadlines for canceling hukou registration for the deceased: in cities, before burial; in rural areas, within one month"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/25-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Funeral services are divided into basic and non-basic categories; a list of basic services exists, with their fees set by law"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/25-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"If you encounter forced bundling, extra charges beyond the listed price, or a single service being split into multiple line items for billing, make a note of it and file a complaint"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/25-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Intermediaries such as funeral service agents, vendors of funeral goods, and event planners must register with the county-level civil affairs bureau"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/25-09","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Retrieving scattered funds: housing provident fund balances, social insurance payouts, and work‑related death benefits"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/25-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Relatives of the deceased may request access to, copies of, corrections to, and deletion of their personal information"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":